===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To offer [[illicit]] sex with a third party; to [[pimp]].
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[tempt]] with, to [[appeal]] or [[cater]] to ([[improper]] [[motivations]], etc.); to assist in the gratification of.
#: ''His latest speech simply seems to '''pander''' to the worst instincts of the electorate.''

